WEBVTT

01:40.380 --> 01:45.789
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.270 --> 01:50.910
[Episode 10]

02:09.400 --> 02:11.660
There are many injustices in this world.

02:13.530 --> 02:16.150
My heart is growing increasingly restless.

02:43.010 --> 02:44.540
You gave me a golden orchid.

02:44.690 --> 02:46.760
I should respond with sincerity.

02:47.600 --> 02:48.980
Dongfang Huaizhu.

02:49.460 --> 02:50.970
I am Wangquan Hongye.

03:06.580 --> 03:08.390
I have things I must do.

03:08.610 --> 03:09.890
I cannot fail.

03:13.570 --> 03:14.830
Be careful.

03:15.360 --> 03:18.490
Be careful of the Yiqi Alliance, that man-eating beast.

03:19.640 --> 03:21.000
Young Master Wangquan,

03:21.590 --> 03:22.990
let's part ways here.

03:23.120 --> 03:24.860
We may never meet again.

03:56.690 --> 03:59.220
She is the descendant of the Spiritual Blood.

04:00.000 --> 04:01.300
Interesting.

04:14.870 --> 04:17.060
There's no news of the masked person and the great demon yet.

04:17.060 --> 04:18.579
We must find them.

04:18.700 --> 04:20.890
Yes. I'll take my leave then.

04:24.120 --> 04:24.920
Eat some.

04:26.120 --> 04:26.980
I'll eat later.

04:28.390 --> 04:29.680
It's just a breakup.

04:29.830 --> 04:31.560
You can't starve yourself over it.

04:31.560 --> 04:32.960
Thanks for the reminder.

04:33.050 --> 04:35.760
Love and life are alike—

04:37.190 --> 04:39.600
neither is ever smooth sailing.

04:41.270 --> 04:42.600
Who taught you all this?

04:43.159 --> 04:44.490
I figured it out myself.

04:45.070 --> 04:46.040
Let's talk business.

04:46.040 --> 04:47.890
About the great demon you found in Beast Kingdom...

04:47.890 --> 04:50.150
Can you take Yitan and me to investigate?

04:58.640 --> 05:00.540
Hongye, it's an urgent matter.

05:00.740 --> 05:02.580
While tracking the demonic aura in the dungeon in Beast Kingdom,

05:02.580 --> 05:04.940
I found that the great demon went to Divine Fire Villa twice.

05:04.940 --> 05:06.130
Divine Fire Villa?

05:22.680 --> 05:24.190
From the ledger,

05:24.920 --> 05:26.830
you seem meticulous and precise,

05:28.040 --> 05:30.700
but your handwriting is free and unrestrained.

05:30.780 --> 05:32.590
I'm curious about you.

05:40.240 --> 05:41.240
Who are you?

05:44.970 --> 05:46.350
To me,

05:47.120 --> 05:48.920
you are someone very important.

05:49.830 --> 05:51.800
In order to take you away smoothly,

05:52.600 --> 05:54.390
I've already been here twice.

05:56.820 --> 05:58.860
Resistance is futile.

06:27.430 --> 06:28.310
Huaizhu!

06:42.880 --> 06:45.310
[20 years later]

06:49.370 --> 06:51.909
[Sky City]
[Rebirth Pool]

07:43.600 --> 07:45.620
The Golden Dawn?

07:47.480 --> 07:50.930
The Golden Dawn, the sacred relic of our Netherworld Clan,

07:49.080 --> 07:51.210
[Golden Dawn]

07:51.330 --> 07:53.880
has been damaged to this extent?

07:54.510 --> 07:58.770
Who are you to dare trespass into the forbidden land of the Netherworld Clan?

08:07.320 --> 08:09.610
[Ye Yuan, Guardian of the Netherworld Clan]

08:09.800 --> 08:10.720
My Lord?

08:15.190 --> 08:16.990
Five hundred years have passed.

08:17.720 --> 08:21.240
I, Ye Yuan, welcome your return, My Lord.

08:21.390 --> 08:23.750
Welcome back, My Lord.

08:24.070 --> 08:25.380
I came back

08:26.310 --> 08:28.510
to accomplish something significant.

08:29.310 --> 08:30.600
From today on,

08:31.590 --> 08:34.950
Sky City will be the ruler of this world.

08:35.140 --> 08:37.070
Those who follow me will live,

08:37.440 --> 08:39.240
and those who oppose me will die.

09:34.880 --> 09:36.370
Li Quzhuo!

09:40.700 --> 09:42.000
Three hours have passed,

09:42.000 --> 09:43.140
and it's almost dawn.

09:43.140 --> 09:45.030
Aren't you an expert in magical artifacts?

09:45.030 --> 09:47.110
Why is it taking so long, and you still haven't figured it out?

09:47.110 --> 09:48.710
How much longer will it take?

09:48.750 --> 09:50.950
Whoever created this magical artifact

09:51.030 --> 09:52.290
is no ordinary person.

09:54.270 --> 09:56.620
Anyone who could abduct Miss Huaizhu from Hongye's hands

09:56.620 --> 09:58.130
is certainly not an ordinary person.

09:58.130 --> 09:58.960
This is an ancient demonic artifact

09:58.960 --> 10:01.090
capable of tearing through time.

10:01.360 --> 10:03.420
What does tearing through time mean?

10:04.180 --> 10:05.510
Let me explain it to you this way.

10:05.510 --> 10:06.910
The Yiqi Alliance's teleportation talisman

10:06.910 --> 10:08.720
can send people thousands of miles away.

10:08.720 --> 10:09.790
But this magical artifact

10:09.790 --> 10:12.050
can allow people to travel through time.

10:12.400 --> 10:14.060
It can take you back to the past

10:14.120 --> 10:15.550
or send you to the future.

10:16.360 --> 10:18.000
According to the information left on the magical artifact,

10:18.000 --> 10:19.000
they were...

10:20.360 --> 10:21.440
sent to the future.

10:21.910 --> 10:23.240
How far into the future?

10:24.270 --> 10:26.520
They went 20 years into the future.

10:27.750 --> 10:28.730
Why did this great demon

10:28.730 --> 10:30.970
take Miss Dongfang to the future?

10:31.200 --> 10:32.790
We'll find out when we get there.

10:32.790 --> 10:34.200
Li Quzhuo, activate the magical artifact.

10:34.200 --> 10:35.120
Let's go together.

10:35.120 --> 10:36.960
No, I have to stay here

10:36.980 --> 10:39.390
to reverse the magic array and bring you back.

10:39.390 --> 10:42.030
Also, the principle behind tearing through time is extremely complex.

10:42.030 --> 10:43.420
If you go a few hours later,

10:43.420 --> 10:44.680
by the time you arrive,

10:45.150 --> 10:46.880
it'll already be months later.

10:49.150 --> 10:49.790
Hongye,

10:51.270 --> 10:52.510
before dawn today,

10:52.550 --> 10:54.280
I'll definitely have it ready.

10:54.320 --> 10:56.120
By then, take it with you.

10:56.670 --> 10:59.030
Once you find Miss Huaizhu and want to come back,

10:59.030 --> 11:00.230
open it immediately.

11:00.720 --> 11:03.080
It will resonate with the golden lotus here.

11:03.080 --> 11:04.680
But it's a replica after all.

11:05.510 --> 11:06.110
Remember,

11:07.150 --> 11:08.510
it can only be used once.

11:09.430 --> 11:11.310
Got it. Please hurry.

11:32.790 --> 11:33.670
Huaizhu,

11:35.540 --> 11:37.020
maybe one day,

11:37.900 --> 11:40.490
[Jiang Juanxue, Mother of Dongfang Huaizhu]

11:38.030 --> 11:41.440
darkness will overshadow your life.

11:41.870 --> 11:44.040
[Young Dongfang Huaizhu]

11:42.960 --> 11:44.510
But you must believe

11:45.870 --> 11:47.870
that there will definitely be stars

11:48.240 --> 11:49.320
lighting your way.

11:50.080 --> 11:50.600
Mom.

13:33.700 --> 13:34.440
My Lord,

13:34.860 --> 13:36.370
the woman you brought back

13:36.960 --> 13:37.750
has woken up.

13:39.360 --> 13:40.630
You may leave.

13:42.120 --> 13:42.720
Yes.

13:44.780 --> 13:46.710
The wound caused by the dragon bone

13:47.620 --> 13:50.420
cannot heal even with my demonic power.

13:52.030 --> 13:55.030
Only continuous blood consumption can ease the pain.

14:02.730 --> 14:04.680
Do you often have such dreams?

14:06.070 --> 14:07.800
You seem to care about her a lot.

14:09.510 --> 14:10.640
Who exactly are you?

14:11.440 --> 14:12.360
Where am I?

14:14.860 --> 14:16.510
My name is Jiuhuo.

14:17.160 --> 14:18.790
This place is Sky City.

14:19.930 --> 14:21.400
Why did you

14:21.750 --> 14:22.630
bring me here?

14:24.560 --> 14:25.770
I cannot

14:27.150 --> 14:29.080
answer that question for now.

14:36.070 --> 14:37.010
Not bad.

14:37.270 --> 14:39.400
Your strength has exceeded Ye Yuan's.

14:41.900 --> 14:43.560
What exactly do you want to do?

14:46.200 --> 14:48.550
I want to ask for your help.

14:49.670 --> 14:51.680
I want you to save someone.

14:51.960 --> 14:53.750
I don't know what you're talking about,

14:53.750 --> 14:55.480
but I certainly won't help you.

14:55.870 --> 14:57.030
Dongfang Huaizhu,

14:57.610 --> 14:58.760
do you know

15:00.030 --> 15:01.600
why you were born?

15:16.140 --> 15:17.070
What is this?

15:17.870 --> 15:20.520
You injected demonic energy into me?

15:20.630 --> 15:23.160
Your knowledge should not be limited to this.

15:24.150 --> 15:26.900
Feel the strength of this demonic aura.

15:27.390 --> 15:28.870
Sense it.

15:29.360 --> 15:31.820
Has it merged with your marrow

15:32.110 --> 15:33.780
and become one with you?

15:47.510 --> 15:48.350
Impossible.

15:50.000 --> 15:51.400
Absolutely impossible.

15:51.510 --> 15:52.360
So,

15:53.030 --> 15:55.580
do you really know who you are

15:55.810 --> 15:57.410
and why you were born?

16:12.670 --> 16:13.440
Ye Yuan.

16:16.700 --> 16:17.830
I'm here.

16:18.840 --> 16:20.640
It will likely take her a few days

16:20.790 --> 16:22.610
before she wakes up again.

16:23.500 --> 16:26.020
By then, she won't remember who she is.

16:27.160 --> 16:28.440
Just tell her

16:29.240 --> 16:30.300
her name is Huaizhu

16:32.240 --> 16:34.120
and that she is my guardian.

16:35.910 --> 16:36.550
Yes.

16:37.870 --> 16:39.750
The Divine Fire will fade,

16:40.300 --> 16:42.250
the mandrake will bloom,

16:44.390 --> 16:46.870
and Dongfang Huaizhu will cease to exist.

16:47.750 --> 16:48.360
You

16:49.640 --> 16:52.280
will be the perfect vessel for Jia Lan.

17:05.069 --> 17:07.000
Where are we?

17:08.579 --> 17:10.240
This is still Huaizhu's room.

17:12.720 --> 17:13.920
How is this possible?

17:14.680 --> 17:17.010
Where are the people of Divine Fire Villa?

17:20.680 --> 17:21.540
There's no one.

17:22.599 --> 17:24.210
There's no one

17:24.750 --> 17:26.150
in the Divine Fire Villa.

17:30.240 --> 17:31.970
Let's check out Ruyi Pavilion.

18:02.890 --> 18:05.050
How could this happen?

18:05.760 --> 18:07.510
What exactly happened here?

18:09.310 --> 18:11.110
Even Ruyi Pavilion is like this.

18:11.440 --> 18:13.770
There won't be anyone in Qingmu's either.

18:15.240 --> 18:15.790
Let's go.

18:16.550 --> 18:17.310
Help!

18:48.070 --> 18:49.880
Enough. He's already dead.

18:59.960 --> 19:01.740
Miss, don't be afraid.

19:02.080 --> 19:03.640
We are from the Yiqi Alliance.

19:03.640 --> 19:04.640
We won't harm you.

19:05.270 --> 19:06.330
The Yiqi Alliance?

19:07.200 --> 19:09.660
The Yiqi Alliance disbanded five years ago.

19:11.440 --> 19:12.350
Five years ago?

19:13.160 --> 19:14.880
What year is it now?

19:16.810 --> 19:18.540
It's the 37th year of Jingfeng.

19:19.550 --> 19:20.350
What's wrong?

19:20.920 --> 19:22.980
We've really arrived 20 years later.

19:24.240 --> 19:26.040
What happened in this world?

19:26.240 --> 19:27.530
It has been only 20 years,

19:27.530 --> 19:29.200
and how did it become like this?

19:29.200 --> 19:31.000
Either you kill me, or I kill you!

19:31.000 --> 19:31.920
All demons deserve to die!

19:31.920 --> 19:33.250
They all deserve to die!

19:35.110 --> 19:36.240
She seems to have gone mad.

19:36.240 --> 19:37.270
I'm not.

19:38.500 --> 19:40.190
This world is just like this.

19:40.240 --> 19:41.750
The Yiqi Alliance has perished.

19:41.750 --> 19:43.070
Humans and demons are killing each other.

19:43.070 --> 19:44.720
The weak don't even deserve to live.

19:44.720 --> 19:46.270
If I hadn't killed that demon just now,

19:46.270 --> 19:48.030
he would have gone to find his accomplices,

19:48.030 --> 19:49.720
and I'd be the one

19:49.720 --> 19:50.590
who's dead now!

19:50.590 --> 19:51.590
Please calm down.

20:04.660 --> 20:05.980
Tell me,

20:06.290 --> 20:08.070
how did the Yiqi Alliance perish?

20:08.070 --> 20:09.270
How would I know that?

20:12.130 --> 20:13.390
Those noble families…

20:15.400 --> 20:18.140
Those noble families have all fallen.

20:18.590 --> 20:20.510
They no longer care about us.

20:21.100 --> 20:23.260
We were left to fend for ourselves.

20:25.440 --> 20:28.680
The Eternal Night is about to befall.

20:40.720 --> 20:42.070
You are so capable.

20:42.400 --> 20:44.920
Please, take me to Sky City.

20:47.730 --> 20:48.800
I have money.

20:49.200 --> 20:50.720
I have lots and lots of money.

20:50.720 --> 20:51.880
I can give it all to you.

20:51.880 --> 20:52.550
Get up.

20:53.030 --> 20:54.090
I'll give it to you.

20:54.590 --> 20:55.370
All of it.

20:57.540 --> 20:58.170
Tell me,

20:59.440 --> 21:00.590
what is Sky City?

21:03.520 --> 21:06.570
You don't even know about Sky City?

21:07.840 --> 21:11.110
Sky City is the holy capital of the Netherworld Clan.

21:11.510 --> 21:14.310
It's the last paradise for both humans and demons.

21:16.270 --> 21:17.400
She's acting crazy.

21:17.850 --> 21:19.680
Hongye, let's not believe her.

21:22.030 --> 21:24.030
Where is this Sky City

21:24.780 --> 21:25.910
you just mentioned?

21:29.070 --> 21:29.750
Money.

21:31.200 --> 21:32.350
I still have money.

21:37.530 --> 21:40.960
She said Sky City is the holy capital of the Netherworld Clan.

21:41.590 --> 21:44.350
I once used the Clairvoyance to probe that great demon's aura

21:44.350 --> 21:47.010
and confirmed he was from the Netherworld Clan.

21:50.920 --> 21:53.750
Looks like we have to go there now.

23:38.680 --> 23:40.240
Having a soulmate in life

23:40.800 --> 23:42.860
is like discovering a golden orchid.

23:43.350 --> 23:44.150
It's not easy.

23:50.360 --> 23:51.810
However,

23:53.020 --> 23:54.350
Mu Xiaowu is dead,

23:55.570 --> 23:57.010
Chu Jing is gone,

23:58.260 --> 24:00.060
and Yan's lifetime of happiness

24:01.830 --> 24:03.270
has been ruined.

24:04.610 --> 24:06.140
You gave me a golden orchid.

24:06.740 --> 24:08.600
I should respond with sincerity.

24:09.240 --> 24:10.570
Young Master Wangquan,

24:12.070 --> 24:13.070
please stop here.

24:47.310 --> 24:48.820
Sky City?

24:49.760 --> 24:51.550
Sky City! Sky City!

24:51.550 --> 24:52.400
Miss!

25:12.200 --> 25:13.210
Hurry up!

25:15.000 --> 25:15.640
Don't run!

25:15.640 --> 25:16.160
Hurry up!

25:16.160 --> 25:17.820
Let me play with it for a while!

25:17.830 --> 25:19.240
Slow down!

25:19.400 --> 25:20.750
Be careful! Don't trip!

25:20.830 --> 25:22.050
Sky City.

25:23.300 --> 25:25.400
Look! It's Sky City!

25:25.510 --> 25:26.610
I didn't lie to you.

25:26.670 --> 25:28.570
It really is Sky City!

25:29.070 --> 25:31.950
It's the last pure land for humans and demons.

25:32.270 --> 25:33.620
I made it.

25:33.790 --> 25:34.830
Sky City!

25:34.850 --> 25:36.270
I really made it!

25:37.120 --> 25:38.580
I made it!

25:39.050 --> 25:40.620
I made it!

25:41.880 --> 25:43.150
Sky City!

25:47.810 --> 25:48.870
Hongye,

25:49.240 --> 25:51.310
this place looks pretty good.

25:51.690 --> 25:54.060
It's the only paradise in hell, after all.

25:56.750 --> 25:57.800
Let's split up.

25:57.830 --> 25:59.350
We'll meet at the inn later.

25:59.350 --> 25:59.960
Alright.

26:01.060 --> 26:01.870
The usual way.

26:02.310 --> 26:02.840
Let's go.

26:17.350 --> 26:18.610
That's what he told me.

26:18.790 --> 26:19.510
Yes.

26:19.590 --> 26:21.520
Lord Ye Yuan is really formidable.

26:23.000 --> 26:24.320
Miss, take a look.

26:25.490 --> 26:26.450
Make way!

26:26.750 --> 26:27.590
Make way!

26:27.640 --> 26:28.590
Stop!

26:29.590 --> 26:30.400
Make way!

26:30.680 --> 26:31.310
Stop!

26:34.200 --> 26:35.270
Don't run!

26:37.550 --> 26:38.400
Stop!

26:39.790 --> 26:40.310
This one.

26:40.310 --> 26:41.370
I'll take this one.

26:41.550 --> 26:43.280
The Left Guardian is on patrol!

26:43.590 --> 26:45.110
Those with grievances,

26:45.310 --> 26:47.150
speak up!

26:47.350 --> 26:48.200
The Left Guardian?

26:48.200 --> 26:49.030
It's her?

26:49.030 --> 26:50.000
Yes.

26:51.310 --> 26:53.340
The Left Guardian is on patrol!

26:53.590 --> 26:55.310
Those with grievances,

26:55.510 --> 26:57.400
speak up!

27:01.500 --> 27:03.380
The Left Guardian is on patrol!

27:03.790 --> 27:05.550
Those with grievances,

27:05.720 --> 27:07.820
speak up!

27:08.000 --> 27:09.510
I have a grievance!

27:10.500 --> 27:11.730
Stop, stop!

27:12.920 --> 27:13.880
I have a grievance.

27:13.880 --> 27:16.040
Left Guardian, please uphold justice for me!

27:16.040 --> 27:17.720
What grievance do you have?

27:18.270 --> 27:19.160
Speak.

27:21.530 --> 27:23.080
He's a demon tamer!

27:23.550 --> 27:25.160
He's a demon tamer!

27:25.890 --> 27:27.580
After arriving in Sky City,

27:27.610 --> 27:30.090
he still used demon-controlling talismans to control me.

27:30.090 --> 27:31.770
I barely managed to escape.

27:31.880 --> 27:33.550
Guardian, save me!

27:33.790 --> 27:35.620
I didn't! He's making it up!

27:35.640 --> 27:36.910
You should know,

27:37.310 --> 27:39.070
this is Sky City.

27:39.570 --> 27:43.750
Our City Lord hates demon-controlling talismans the most.

27:44.840 --> 27:46.310
I didn't control any beasts,

27:46.310 --> 27:49.110
and I don't have any demon-controlling talismans either.

27:49.110 --> 27:50.280
If I'm lying,

27:50.440 --> 27:52.200
may I die a terrible death.

27:52.440 --> 27:53.400
Is that so?

27:54.250 --> 27:56.400
Think carefully before you speak.

28:02.350 --> 28:03.590
Guardian,

28:03.920 --> 28:06.190
I did use a demon-controlling talisman.

28:06.720 --> 28:08.940
As long as I hold the master talisman,

28:09.090 --> 28:11.180
I can have him do anything.

28:11.270 --> 28:12.590
Guardian,

28:12.920 --> 28:14.880
please uphold justice for me!

28:15.240 --> 28:16.960
What did you just say?

28:17.480 --> 28:19.290
Die a terrible death?

28:27.660 --> 28:28.480
Huaizhu.

28:35.930 --> 28:37.130
Thank you, Guardian,

28:37.150 --> 28:38.620
Thank you, City Lord.

28:38.640 --> 28:40.440
Thank you, Sky City!

28:41.200 --> 28:42.730
Sky City in the Netherworld

28:42.880 --> 28:44.400
is our last pure land!

28:45.400 --> 28:47.270
Sky City in the Netherworld

28:47.440 --> 28:49.510
is our last pure land!

28:49.640 --> 28:51.200
It is well known

28:51.640 --> 28:53.910
that since the Yiqi Alliance was gone,

28:53.940 --> 28:56.880
only the strong could survive in this world.

28:57.330 --> 29:00.160
Humans and demons live in constant fear every day.

29:00.950 --> 29:02.670
Only Sky City

29:03.210 --> 29:07.240
is the paradise where humans and demons can coexist.

29:07.550 --> 29:09.960
I swear my undying loyalty to Sky City,

29:10.310 --> 29:11.830
ready to face any danger without hesitation,

29:11.830 --> 29:13.380
and I will never betray it.

29:13.510 --> 29:15.110
If you have no place to stay,

29:15.990 --> 29:18.450
you may stay at Golden Dawn Inn temporarily.

29:18.550 --> 29:19.700
It is very safe there.

29:19.700 --> 29:21.460
Thank you, Guardian.

29:22.620 --> 29:24.340
As for that unfortunate one,

29:24.640 --> 29:27.510
drag him back and hang him at the city gate

29:27.590 --> 29:29.320
to serve as a warning to others.

29:32.890 --> 29:33.960
Dongfang Huaizhu!

29:37.110 --> 29:38.360
Who is he?

29:40.440 --> 29:41.550
Who is he?

29:51.700 --> 29:53.050
Don't you recognize me?

29:56.490 --> 29:58.210
Should I?

30:54.410 --> 30:57.120
Your sword has no killing intent at all.

30:57.200 --> 30:59.160
You're so reluctant to hurt me.

30:59.390 --> 31:01.340
This actually makes me a little curious.

31:01.340 --> 31:02.800
You are Dongfang Huaizhu,

31:02.870 --> 31:04.070
not some guardian.

31:04.360 --> 31:05.640
If you don't remember,

31:06.020 --> 31:07.320
I will help you recall.

31:26.830 --> 31:27.760
Please, come in.

31:29.750 --> 31:30.720
Take care.

31:31.120 --> 31:32.640
[Golden Dawn Inn]

31:32.790 --> 31:33.510
Take care.

31:36.440 --> 31:37.510
Sir,

31:38.360 --> 31:39.810
are you looking for accommodation?

31:39.810 --> 31:42.170
The Left Guardian told me to stay here.

31:42.200 --> 31:44.260
She said it's very safe here.

31:44.720 --> 31:45.940
But...

31:47.150 --> 31:49.290
But I don't have any money.

31:50.200 --> 31:52.030
You are a distinguished guest of Sky City.

31:52.030 --> 31:53.220
Money is not a concern.

31:53.220 --> 31:54.350
Please, this way.

31:55.230 --> 31:55.960
Come on.

31:56.050 --> 31:56.550
This way.

31:56.550 --> 31:57.150
Thank you.

31:59.410 --> 32:00.030
Come on.

32:00.030 --> 32:00.640
Here's your tea.

32:00.640 --> 32:01.350
Please go upstairs.

32:01.350 --> 32:01.880
Alright.

32:04.160 --> 32:04.510
Come on.

32:04.290 --> 32:07.980
[Demon]

32:04.510 --> 32:06.310
Here's your food. Please enjoy.

32:09.590 --> 32:13.030
Finally. Here comes another great demon.

32:13.200 --> 32:16.930
The Golden Dawn can be repaired soon.

32:37.070 --> 32:38.400
In a few days,

32:38.770 --> 32:42.490
the remaining ones will be refined.

32:43.470 --> 32:47.150
We've put in a lot of effort to gather

32:47.920 --> 32:51.200
a thousand pieces of the Golden Dawn fragments.

32:52.420 --> 32:53.240
Be careful.

32:53.790 --> 32:55.500
Even if one fragment is lost,

32:55.520 --> 32:58.300
Lord Ye Yuan will kill us.

32:58.470 --> 33:00.180
Don't worry, Boss.

33:21.880 --> 33:22.960
Left Guardian,

33:23.200 --> 33:25.610
should we inform Lord Jiuhuo

33:25.720 --> 33:27.720
about what happened outside today?

33:31.780 --> 33:34.670
Loyalty is a good thing.

33:34.830 --> 33:36.030
But people

33:36.400 --> 33:37.510
only have one life.

33:39.130 --> 33:40.640
I understand.

33:41.270 --> 33:42.440
I won't say a word

33:42.550 --> 33:44.160
about your business!

33:48.050 --> 33:49.240
I'm sorry!

33:53.910 --> 33:55.300
Don't you recognize me?

33:55.660 --> 33:57.210
You are Dongfang Huaizhu,

33:57.240 --> 33:58.330
not some guardian.

33:58.740 --> 34:00.000
If you don't remember,

34:00.360 --> 34:01.750
I'll help you recall.

34:02.850 --> 34:04.670
Ridiculous.

34:05.580 --> 34:08.670
What does Dongfang Huaizhu have to do with me?

34:17.170 --> 34:19.590
Hongye has taken the antidote for the demon poison.

34:19.590 --> 34:20.989
He should be fine, right?

34:30.239 --> 34:31.850
How could this be?

34:31.900 --> 34:34.230
Why does she have demonic aura in her body?

34:34.429 --> 34:37.040
And it flows smoothly, as if it's part of her.

34:37.650 --> 34:38.650
Huaizhu,

34:39.940 --> 34:41.600
what exactly happened to you?

34:57.400 --> 34:58.510
City Lord,

34:58.550 --> 34:59.630
my name is Liu.

34:59.880 --> 35:02.200
Guardian Ye Yuan sent me to serve you.

35:27.150 --> 35:28.150
Is my face

35:28.880 --> 35:30.150
so terrifying?

35:41.280 --> 35:42.440
Lift your head.

35:47.400 --> 35:49.070
You'll die for me.

35:49.950 --> 35:51.980
I will remember your face.

36:10.000 --> 36:11.050
Left Guardian?

36:11.110 --> 36:12.570
Lord Jiuhuo has instructed

36:12.570 --> 36:14.770
that no one is allowed to enter his room.

36:14.820 --> 36:16.690
I have an urgent matter to report.

36:45.390 --> 36:46.620
Lord Jiuhuo.

36:53.650 --> 36:55.250
Why is there a smell of blood?

36:56.550 --> 36:58.210
My Lord, are you alright?

37:08.760 --> 37:10.230
My Lord, you're injured?

37:38.760 --> 37:39.920
Leave.

37:41.820 --> 37:43.250
I'm tired.

37:43.780 --> 37:44.660
My Lord.

37:50.230 --> 37:52.070
Leave.

38:15.230 --> 38:16.360
Ye Yuan!

38:20.820 --> 38:22.560
My Lord, you were interrupted while consuming blood.

38:22.560 --> 38:24.890
I'll go find new food for you immediately.

38:31.290 --> 38:32.120
My Lord,

38:32.720 --> 38:33.840
I'm sorry.

38:34.250 --> 38:36.960
I've told you before,

38:37.440 --> 38:41.110
she is very important to me.

38:43.340 --> 38:44.860
Are you jealous?

38:45.800 --> 38:46.900
Lord Jiuhuo,

38:47.280 --> 38:48.610
I will never do it again.

38:56.360 --> 38:58.190
There won't be a next time?

39:00.750 --> 39:02.040
Definitely.
